ercent utilization' without noting the ASG max of 6 is never exercised in the priced BOM, so the priced capacity and the claimed scale-out protection are not the same thing. Minor: 'db.t3.medium for memory headroom under read load' is asserted without evidence, and no read replica is justified against N3/read scaling."}
